abel":"正文","text":"宫遂以其众东迎布为兖州牧据濮阳郡县皆应","evidence":["lvzang-q-b3250c90b491c95f1382"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"遣守","evidence":["xunyu-e-o007a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0100","role":"守备","evidence":["xunyu-e-o007a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0062","role":"反叛","evidence":["xunyu-e-o007a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0096","role":"反叛","evidence":["xunyu-e-o007a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0088","role":"入兖","evidence":["xunyu-e-o007a-q"]},{"person":"zhangle-p0013","role":"邈弟、与太祖将陈宫从事中郎许汜王楷共谋叛太祖","evidence":["lvzang-q-885fbc677134ff2bf0ce"]},{"person":"lvzang-p0020","role":"从事中郎、同谋","evidence":["lvzang-q-885fbc677134ff2bf0ce"]},{"person":"lvzang-p0012","role":"从事中郎、同谋","evidence":["lvzang-q-885fbc677134ff2bf0ce"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":194,"label":"兴平元年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xunyu-y194","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xunyu-q-o007","basis":"兴平元年"},"evidence":["xunyu-e-o007a-q","xunyu-q-o007","xianzhu-q-o009","wudi-q-o028","wudi-q-b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe"]},"ordering_evidence":"xunyu-e-o007a-q","source_order":[10,25,"O007a"],"order":2398}],"persons":[{"id":"lvzang-p0020","name":"许汜","evidence":["lvzang-q-885fbc677134ff2bf0ce","lvzang-q-f97622f501073c0c1a8f","lvzang-q-4257aa29391d93dce682","lvzang-q-1ef9e5bfbdab62365391"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-2a691ff7a7b4ba0ae8ea","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-0a2e547f2671d6ca6014","layer":"original","quote":"张邈等叛迎吕布，郡县响应，唯鄄城、范、东阿不动。","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":13,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":74,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-10a5f253783ea9fd167c","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-85fca35ed52fc59a591c","layer":"original","quote":"备因言曰：“若元龙文武胆志，当求之于古耳〖16〗！造次难得比也","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":130,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-1ef9e5bfbdab62365391","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-34ee8404b5682e6bd0e4","layer":"pei","quote":"布遣许汜、王楷，告急于术。术曰：‘布不与我女，理自当败，何为复来相闻邪！’汜、楷曰：‘明上今不救布，为自败耳：布破，明上亦破也。’术时僭号，故呼为‘明上’。术乃严兵为布作声援","attribution":"裴注·英雄记","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":120,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0324e650424a8aac337a","start":11,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-4257aa29391d93dce682","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-149b73d54415f482d91e","layer":"original","quote":"备问汜：“君言豪，宁有事邪〖7〗？”汜曰：“昔遭乱过下邳，见元龙。元龙无客主之意〖8〗，久不相与语；自上大床卧〖9〗，使客卧下床〖10〗。”备曰：“君有国士之名〖11〗，今天下大乱，帝主失所〖12〗，望君忧国忘家，有救世之意；而君求田问舍〖13〗，言无可采，是元龙所讳也。何缘当与君语〖14〗？如小人〖15〗，欲卧百尺楼上，卧君于地；何但上下床之间邪！”表大笑","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":180,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-885fbc677134ff2bf0ce","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-3ecb53f343c9ec34aa0e","layer":"original","quote":"邈弟超，与太祖将陈宫，从事中郎许汜、王楷，共谋叛太祖。宫说邈曰：“今雄杰并起，天下分崩；君以千里之众〖6〗，当四战之地〖7〗，抚剑顾眄〖8〗，亦足以为人豪；而反制于人，不以鄙乎？今州军东征〖9〗，其处空虚；吕布壮士，善战无前；若权迎之，共牧兖州；观天下形势，俟时事之变通〖10〗：此亦纵横之一时也！”邈从之","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":44,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":164,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-b3250c90b491c95f1382","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-3ecb53f343c9ec34aa0e","layer":"original","quote":"太祖初使宫将兵留屯东郡，遂以其众，东迎布为兖州牧，据濮阳，郡县皆应。唯鄄城、东阿、范，为太祖守","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":44,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":165,"end":212,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-f97622f501073c0c1a8f","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-b6a315a7be9ecf135407","layer":"original","quote":"后许汜与刘备，并在荆州牧刘表坐，表与备共论天下人〖2〗。汜曰：“陈元龙，（湖）〔淮〕海之士〖3〗，豪气不除〖4〗。”备谓表曰：“许君论是非〖5〗？”表曰：“欲言非，此君为善士〖6〗，不宜虚言；欲言是，元龙名重天下","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":106,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：兴平二年（公元 195）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8c38464987eb86819ded","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o028","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fefe0240b8480efce927","layer":"original","quote":"兴平元年春，太祖自徐州还〖1〗。初，太祖父嵩，去官后还谯。董卓之乱，避难琅邪〖2〗。为陶谦所害，故太祖志在复仇东伐。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o009","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-939a0c2b5149377c476b","layer":"original","quote":"谦表先主为豫州刺史，屯小沛〖2〗。谦病笃，谓别驾麋竺曰〖3〗：“非刘备，不能安此州也！”谦死，竺率州人迎先主。先主未敢当，下邳陈登谓先主曰：“今汉室陵迟，海内倾覆；立功立事，在于今日！（彼）〔鄙〕州殷富〖4〗，户口百万；欲屈使君，抚临州事。”先主曰：“袁公路近在寿春〖5〗；此君四世五公〖6〗，海内所归；君可以州与之。”登曰：“公路骄豪，非治乱之主！今欲为使君合步骑十万：上可以匡主济民，成五霸之业〖7〗；下可以割地守境，书功于竹帛。若使君不见听许，登亦未敢听使君也！”北海相孔融谓先主曰：“袁公路岂忧国忘家者邪？冢中枯骨〖8〗，何足介意！今日之事，百姓与能〖9〗；天与不取，悔不可追！”先主遂领徐州。﹝一﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":304,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-e-o007a-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-0a1838dcb6c559056287","layer":"original","quote":"兴平元年，太祖征陶谦，任彧留事〖4〗。会张邈、陈宫以兖州反，潜迎吕布。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":24,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o007","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-0a1838dcb6c559056287","layer":"original","quote":"兴平元年，太祖征陶谦，任彧留事〖4〗。会张邈、陈宫以兖州反，潜迎吕布。布既至，邈乃使刘翊告彧曰：“吕将军来助曹使君击陶谦〖5〗。宜亟供其军食！”众疑惑。彧知邈为乱，即勒兵设备〖6〗；驰召东郡太守夏侯惇。而兖州诸城皆应布矣。时太祖悉军攻谦，留守兵少；而督将、大吏多与邈、宫通谋〖7〗。惇至，其夜诛谋叛者数十人，众乃定。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":24,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":158,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
